    "detailed_description": "SUPPORT THE DEVELOPMENT AND JOIN THE DISCORD COMMUNITY<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832160/extras/9c5708eccc1288b3c63c19884a4d3da6.avif?t=1720868784\" width=444 height=208 /></span><br><br>The Raptured is a TPS horror survival video game that follows Fletcher in Still Pines, overrun by apparitions that stalk the player. Find out what happened to the town, and try not to be consumed by the treacherous hordes of the apparitions.<br><br>The Raptured is a narrative-driven videogame experience that is fictitiously set in the 1990s after the Cold War and immerses the audience in misconstrued reality. Two novice journalists meet together to investigate a dodgy tip from someone anonymous, but little do they know, they are stumbling into the illegal testing grounds of a dangerous PMC.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832160/extras/36b038fdedb794c9f58ef4941f06047e.avif?t=1720868784\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>",
